expression: own
---
Remove installed plugins from this project, or globally

Usage: rover plugin uninstall [OPTIONS] <NAME[@=VERSION]>...

Arguments:
  <NAME[@=VERSION]>...
          The plugins to remove, each as `<NAME>` to remove every installed version, or `<NAME>@=<VERSION>` to remove only that one, e.g. `supergraph` or `router@=2.1.0`

Options:
  -g, --global
          Remove from the global install root, shared by every project, even inside a project that has its own
  -m, --manifest-path <FILE>
          Remove from the project whose manifest this is, rather than the one found by searching up from the working directory
